  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0040_574239c5724d.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.14653in;height:1.48681in\" /></p><p>Equation of <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> is <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math><br />Area <math><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;square units</p>"
